/* 用户协议全文：顶栏同「关于知鹿」，正文放在一张白色大圆角卡片里，字号行距同登录页协议弹窗。 */
page { background: #FAFAFA; }

.doc-page { position: relative; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; background: #FAFAFA; color: #24332D; }
.doc-topbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 20; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FAFAFA; }
.doc-topbar-inner { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; box-sizing: content-box; padding: 0 32rpx 16rpx; }
.doc-back { display: flex; flex: 0 0 auto; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 54rpx; height: 54rpx; border-radius: 50%; }
.doc-back:active { background: #F0F2EF; }
.doc-back-icon { width: 22rpx; height: 22rpx; border-bottom: 4rpx solid #24332D; border-left: 4rpx solid #24332D; transform: rotate(45deg) scale(.7); }
.doc-topbar-title { position: absolute; left: 50%; display: block; color: #24332D; font-size: 36rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1rpx; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }
.doc-scroll { position: relative; z-index: 1; height: 100vh; box-sizing: border-box; }
.doc-shell { min-height: 100%; padding: 12rpx 32rpx calc(48rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); box-sizing: border-box; }

.doc-title { display: block; padding: 0 4rpx; color: #24332D; font-size: 36rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; }
.doc-meta { display: block; margin-top: 14rpx; padding: 0 4rpx; color: #8C938F; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.doc-card { margin-top: 28rpx; padding: 32rpx 28rpx 8rpx; border-radius: 36rpx; background: #fff; }
.doc-section { margin-bottom: 8rpx; }
.doc-heading { display: block; margin-bottom: 12rpx; color: #24332D; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.6; }
.doc-paragraph { display: block; margin-bottom: 24rpx; color: #4D5752; font-size: 27rpx; line-height: 1.75; }

/* 平板（2026-11-07 用户：「测评和知鹿服务里的页面也都要跟平板适配」）：默认大屏模式把页面收进 450px 居中栏，平板上只占中间一条。
   这一页放宽到 LARGE_SCREEN_READING_COLUMN（760px，utils/screen.js）：列表、表单、阅读类页面再宽一行就太长，顶栏、底栏跟着这一栏走。 */
@media (min-width: 450px) {
  page { --lg-col: 760px; }
}

@import "./index.large.wxss"; /* 平板、电脑大屏样式：由 scripts/build-large-screen-styles.mjs 生成，改完本文件后重跑；这一行须留在文件末尾 */
